  "measurement": "Fresh process/tree per run, serialized on CPU4; alternate before/current order each repeat; report medians of5. Timed loops include allocation and checksum, excluding trace generation, construction, reservation, verification and output. No compile/test/other benchmark ran concurrently.",
  "memory": "Process peak RSS captured before independent reference verification, including input traces, tree storage and transient vector reallocation. Search also holds its preparation trace and probe trace; 128-bit search additionally holds a separate vector of 500000 128-bit thresholds.",
  "variants": {
    "before_storage": "Compressed Patricia implementation immediately before leaf/branch pool separation and explicit lazy search stack, rebuilt from session snapshots. Historical measurements remain in the before_storage report.",
    "current": "Final workspace implementation, separate leaf/branch pools; ordinary tree allocation/join helpers kept out of line; lazy boundary search uses a compact stack with correct object lifetime."
  },
  "validation": "Every variant/condition independently verified once after timing; all5 repeat checksums and logical node counts agree. Ordinary uses a compressed Fenwick reference, lazy mixed uses two independent integral Fenwick trees, lazy search uses independently computed compressed prefix sums. Randomized/structural tests, generic owning and non-default-constructible value/action tests, exceptional predicate lifetime tests, 128-bit coordinate/aggregate tests and utility two-TU tests passed O2 warning builds and ASan+UBSan. Leak detection disabled due ptrace environment.",
  "changes": [
    "Separate leaf and branch pools, retaining logical node_count and reserve_nodes behavior; ordinary scalar leaves16B versus32B branches, lazy 64-bit sum/length leaves24B versus48B branches.",
    "Keep ordinary allocation and join helpers out of line; retain recursive set after iterative set measured slower.",
    "Replace lazy boundary start-path recursion with a bounded explicit stack; align raw storage and manage F lifetime without requiring a default constructor; reorder frames from32B to24B for int64 indices/actions.",
    "Retain pow, mapping(F,S), the uniform-init constructor and const queries that do not grow nodes.",
    "Preserve requested library style and remove prod2 and the obsolete array file.",
    "Add N=10^9 and10^18 aggregate/coordinate regression tests, including sums and boundary limits exceeding LLONG_MAX."
  ],
  "tradeoffs": "Not a universal optimum. All3 existing distributions and every measured result are retained. The comparison here is paired remeasurement against the immediately preceding compressed implementation, not the original uncompressed pool; original pool comparisons remain in archived reports. Timing depends on compiler, CPU and workload. Lazy prefetch and allocation outlining did not consistently improve timing and were rejected.",
